; Room script table: the address of the script of each room 0-25
;
; Word n is the address of the script of room n (#R$9D5F runs it when #R$86B9 enters the room): index = room number
; #R$8509 times 2, 26 entries. The scripts follow from $726A in the same order, each followed by the subscripts that
; belong to the rooms around it. Room 25 is the ending room (#R$887B).
@label=RoomScriptTable
@isub=DEFW RoomScript00,RoomScript01,RoomScript02,RoomScript03
w$7236 DEFW $726A,$72A0,$72F1,$7368
@isub=DEFW RoomScript04,RoomScript05,RoomScript06,RoomScript07
 $723E DEFW $73BE,$7453,$7519,$75E1
